@startuml
autonumber
actor "ATCC" as Actor
participant ":FlightRouteController" as Ctrl
participant ":FlightRouteService" as Service
participant "routeRepository\n:FlightRouteRepository" as Repo
participant "route\n:FlightRoute" as Route
participant "dto\n:FlightRouteResponseDTO" as DTO

activate Actor
Actor -> Ctrl: GET /api/flight-routes/{id}
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Service: getRouteById(id)
activate Service

Service -> Repo: findById(id)
activate Repo
Repo --> Service: Optional<FlightRoute>
deactivate Repo

Service --> Ctrl: route
deactivate Service

Ctrl -> DTO**: create(route)
note right of DTO: Maps domain entity to DTO\nand adds HATEOAS _links

Ctrl --> Actor: 200 OK (FlightRouteResponseDTO)
deactivate Ctrl
deactivate Actor
@enduml